\b Global Sports ID Privacy Policy\b0\par
\par
Last updated: March 12, 2026\par
\par
\b 1. Introduction\b0\par
Global Sports ID ("we", "our", "us") provides a platform for players and coaches to create profiles, discover opportunities, communicate, and share sports-related information.\par
\par
This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, how we store it, and the choices available to users.\par
\par
\b 2. Information We Collect\b0\par
We may collect the following information:\par
- Full name\par
- Email address\par
- Password and authentication information handled through Supabase Auth\par
- Role information such as player or coach\par
- Sport selection\par
- Team, city, country, nationality, age, position, gender, biography, stats, and highlights link\par
- Profile photo, if uploaded\par
- Messages, contact requests, trials, and offers created through the app\par
- Technical information needed to operate the app, such as session and authentication data\par
\par
\b 3. How We Use Information\b0\par
We use collected information to:\par
- Create and manage user accounts\par
- Display player and coach profiles\par
- Match users within the same sport\par
- Enable messaging, contact requests, trials, and offers\par
- Maintain security, prevent abuse, and enforce platform rules\par
- Improve and support the app\par
\par
\b 4. How Information Is Shared\b0\par
We do not sell personal information.\par
\par
Information may be shared:\par
- With other users, where profile and communication features require it\par
- With service providers that help us operate the app, including hosting, authentication, and database infrastructure\par
- If required by law, regulation, legal process, or to protect rights and safety\par
\par
\b 5. User Visibility\b0\par
Because Global Sports ID is a networking platform:\par
- Profile information may be visible to other authenticated users within the same sport\par
- Messages and requests are only intended to be visible to the relevant participants\par
- Trials and offers may be visible to authenticated users within the same sport\par
\par
\b 6. Data Storage and Security\b0\par
We use technical and organizational measures intended to protect user information, including:\par
- Secure authentication\par
- Access controls\par
- Database security policies\par
- Restricted data access based on role and sport\par
\par
No system can be guaranteed 100 percent secure, but we take reasonable steps to protect information.\par
\par
\b 7. Data Retention\b0\par
We retain information for as long as reasonably necessary to operate the service, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce agreements.\par
\par
\b 8. User Rights\b0\par
Depending on where a user lives, they may have rights to:\par
- Access their data\par
- Correct their data\par
- Request deletion of their data\par
- Object to certain uses of their data\par
\par
Requests can be made using the contact details below.\par
\par
\b 9. Children and Age Requirements\b0\par
Users should only use the platform if they are legally permitted to do so in their jurisdiction. If we learn that personal data was collected improperly, we may remove the related account or information.\par
\par
\b 10. International Users\b0\par
If users access the app from outside the country where our systems operate, their information may be processed in other countries where our service providers operate.\par
\par
\b 11. Changes to This Policy\b0\par
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Updated versions will be posted with a revised effective date.\par
\par
\b 12. Contact\b0\par
For privacy questions or requests, contact:\par
- Email: info@globalsportsid.com\par
